  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Realistic_Animals/BH_Realistic_Animals_header.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"450\"></strong></span></span></a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">此资源包改变了Minecraft许多原版动物的外观！具体来说，目前它改变了以下动物的外观（不过还有更多纹理正在制作中）：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 牛</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 羊</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 猪</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 鸡</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 豹猫</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 狼</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 猫</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 熊猫</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 哞菇</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 骆驼</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 骆驼僵尸</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 海龟</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 马</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">需要安装 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-model-features\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMF</a> 或 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-texture-features-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">ETF</a>（也支持 OptiFine）。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">牛、羊、猪、鸡、熊猫和哞菇的纹理及模型设计师是 AviArt。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">豹猫、狼和猫的纹理及模型设计师是 Matt_Hopes。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>需要一个和朋友一起玩的服务器吗？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Realistic_Animals/BH_Realistic_Animals_promo.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"250\"></span></a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">如果你正在寻找一个能和朋友们玩任何模组或整合包的服务器，<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bisect Hosting</a></strong></span> 就是你的解决方案！他们提供性价比最高的Minecraft服务器，点击<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">此链接</a></strong></span>并使用代码 \"Lupin\"，即可享受25%的折扣。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Realistic_Animals/BH_Realistic_Animals_summary.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"151\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">此资源包改变了社区中最受欢迎的一些原版动物的外观，当然，现在它们将看起来更加真实有趣！但别担心，它们仍将以原版友好的方式呈现，同时与默认纹理保持一定相似度。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Realistic_Animals/BH_Realistic_Animals_faq.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"151\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>它能在服务器上使用吗？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">当然可以！它运行完美！记住，和模组及朋友们一起玩的最佳方式是通过BisectHosting，而<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击此链接可享受25%折扣</a></strong>。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>这个资源包能用在整合包里吗？</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">当然可以！只要它仅在 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 上发布即可。将其上传到任何其他平台将侵犯我们的权益，是绝对不允许的。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">不过，如果你考虑将其加入你的 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 整合包，我们将非常感谢。如果你需要任何小修改或有任何问题，请联系我们！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Realistic_Animals/BH_Realistic_Animals_screenshots.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"151\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/975/599/realistic-pig.png\" width=\"1707\" height=\"960\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/975/600/realistic-cows-1.jpg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"721\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/975/601/realistic-wolves-1.jpg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"721\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/975/603/realistic-cats-7.jpg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"721\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/975/604/realistic-ocelots-1.jpg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"721\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/X8VY5WMbe4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">